# @nativescript/vite's css-tree dependency resolves source-map-js from a
# virtual module with no real on-disk directory to walk up from - hoisting
# it to the workspace root's real node_modules/source-map-js gives that
# resolution a normal, findable path. See ember-native's
# VITE_MIGRATION_NOTES.md ("source-map-js - a different, non-pnpm-specific
# resolution bug") for the full root cause.
public-hoist-pattern[]=source-map-js
